Prices match Ledger: independent quote currencies with corrections and first-seen currency order.

========== CLI ==========

ledlight prices

========== LEDGER-CLI ==========

ledger --args-only --date-format %Y-%m-%d --no-pager prices --sort date,account

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  default
  format 1,000.00 SEK
commodity ZEBRA
  format 1000 ZEBRA
commodity ALPHA
  format 1000 ALPHA
commodity Long_Fund_Name
  format 1000 Long_Fund_Name
commodity UNUSED
  format 1000 UNUSED
account Assets:Funds
account Assets:Cash
account Equity:Opening
account Income:Gains
commodity NOK
  format 1,000.00 NOK

2024-01-01 Purchase
  Assets:Funds  1 ALPHA {10 SEK}
  Assets:Cash  -10 SEK

P 2024-01-02 ALPHA 12 NOK
P 2024-01-02 ALPHA 11 SEK
P 2024-01-02 ALPHA 13 NOK ; corrected
P 2024-01-03 ALPHA 14 NOK

========== OUTPUT ==========

2024-01-01 ALPHA       10.00 SEK
2024-01-02 ALPHA       11.00 SEK
2024-01-02 ALPHA       13.00 NOK
2024-01-03 ALPHA       14.00 NOK
